    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSeeking offers over 225,000\n\nThis is a very nicely presented family home of some 72 sqm. Tucked away in a cul-de-sac setting within this popular estate (and so with little or no passing traffic), No. 58 Lus Mor is a little different internally.On the ground floor is the south facing living room with solid fuel stove. The internal wall has been partially removed to create an open plan area where light bleeds through the entire rooms. To the back is the kitchen with guest WC and understair storage off. This looks onto the back garden which is set mostly to lawn and fully fenced. Upstairs are two double bedrooms, the main bedroom with an en-suite, and the family bathroom.This is a home that is ready to move into and enjoy so if you are a first time buyer, down-sizer or investor, No. 58 might be just what you are looking for.OFCH, south facing to the front, water filtration system fitted, all mains services.\nResident's Fee 120 per annum\nVIEWINGS BEGIN week of 6th July\nAppliances can be purchased separately."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 2.8m x 1.6m\nwith tiled floor\n\nLiving Room - 4.2m x 4.2m\nsouth facing room with laminate flooring, open fire in cast iron and timber surround, open plan into the kitchen area\n\nKitchen - 4.2m x 3.2m\nwith tiled floor, waist and eye level units, electric oven, window to rear and glazed door to back garden. L shaped island 1.2m x 0.6m and 1.1m x 0.6m\n\nGuest WC - 1.8m x 1m\nwith tiled floor and part-tiled walls, WC, WHB and shelving\n\nUnderstair Storage - 1.1m x 0.8m\naccessed from kitchen area\n\nLanding - 4.3m x 2.1m\ncarpet on stairs and laminate flooring on landing, window over rear garden, attic hatch\n\nHot Press - 0.9m x 0.8m\nshelved\n\nBathroom - 3m x 2m\nwith laminate flooring, WC, WHB, bath with shower overhead\n\nBedroom 1 - 4.3m x 2.8m\nwith laminate flooring, fitted double wardrobe with sliding doors\n\nEn-Suite - 3.1m x 1.1m\nwith WC, WHB, electric shower with tiled surround and lots of glass shelving for storage\n\nBedroom 2 - 3m x 2.4m\nwith laminate flooring\n\n"
      },
      {
